    The footer reads "© 2018 GURSEY | SCHNEIDER LLP" on the same template as an article published on 25 August 2026, eight years out of date. The people directory is worse, because a default load returns "Your search has returned no results. Please try again," so the roster never appears at all. You therefore cannot check who would work on your case without asking.
